*To: Hiring Manager*

I’m excited to apply for the Growth Engineer role at Heard. I build systems that turn ambiguous tasks into repeatable, measurable workflows: at Manulife, I refined ServiceNow automation handling 1K+ cross-system operations each day, adding validation and failure handling so the workflow could scale reliably. In my projects, I’ve built agents that use tools and context to complete multi-step work—from a PantryPilot meal-planning agent to a Slack assistant that retrieves Slack/Jira context and adapts responses to user needs—and an Anchor monitoring agent that ranks anomalies and proposes investigation queries. I focus on making these systems controllable through clear workflows, feedback, and evaluation rather than treating an LLM response as success by itself. I regularly use Cursor and GitHub Copilot to plan, implement, and iterate on software, and bring Python, TypeScript, data, and product experience to identify useful opportunities, ship experiments, measure outcomes, and turn what works into dependable infrastructure. I’d be excited to help Heard build the internal agentic systems that make its own growth more effective.
\ Sincerely, \
Jian Feng

